graph TB
    subgraph Internet [Jaringan Publik Internet]
        DNS[Cloudflare / DNS Provider<br/>ngodingpakeprd.com]
        Client[Pengguna Web / Browser HTTPS]
    end

    subgraph HostServer [Virtual Private Server VPS / Coolify Host]
        NginxProxy[Reverse Proxy / Ingress Caddy / Traefik<br/>SSL Termination Let's Encrypt]
        
        subgraph DockerNet [Docker Bridge Network]
            AppContainer[Container: prd-architect<br/>Node.js 22 Slim Standalone Runtime<br/>Port 3000 Internal]
        end
    end

    subgraph ManagedCloud [Layanan Cloud Terkelola]
        SupaCloud[Supabase Cloud<br/>PostgreSQL 15, PgBouncer, Storage, GoTrue]
        GoogleCloud[Google AI Cloud<br/>Generative Language Endpoint API]
        MPGHost[Server Gateway MPG<br/>pyamentgateway.daeroom.my.id]
    end

    Client -->|HTTPS 443| DNS
    DNS --> NginxProxy
    NginxProxy -->|HTTP Proxy Pass| AppContainer

    AppContainer -->|WSS / HTTPS Port 5432| SupaCloud
    AppContainer -->|HTTPS REST| GoogleCloud
    AppContainer -->|HTTPS REST| MPGHost
    MPGHost -->|Webhook POST Callback| NginxProxy
